  "name": "URETHERAL SMEAR EXAMINATION",
  "code": "1487",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<div class=\"group relative\">\n<div class=\"w-full overflow-x-auto md:max-w-[90vw] border-borderMain/50 ring-borderMain/50 divide-borderMain/50 dark:divide-borderMainDark/50 dark:ring-borderMainDark/50 dark:border-borderMainDark/50 bg-transparent\">\n<table class=\"border-borderMain my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\">Gram Stain Finding</th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\">Interpretation</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Many polymorphonuclear leukocytes (PUS cells)</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Indicates active&nbsp;inflammation, may suggest infection (e.g., bacterial urethritis).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Gram-negative intracellular diplococci</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Highly suggestive of&nbsp;Neisseria gonorrhoeae&nbsp;(Gonorrhea). Confirm by culture or NAAT.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">No organisms seen, but many pus cells</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Could indicate&nbsp;non-gonococcal urethritis (NGU)&nbsp;&mdash; often caused by&nbsp;Chlamydia trachomatis&nbsp;or&nbsp;Mycoplasma genitalium. Requires PCR confirmation.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Yeast-like organisms (budding/fungal forms)</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Suggestive of&nbsp;candidal urethritis&nbsp;&mdash; uncommon, may occur in immunocompromised patients or diabetes.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Clue cells / Trichomonads</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Trichomonas vaginalis may be noted; more commonly detected in vaginal smears. Rare in urethral swabs.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">No pus cells and no organisms</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Normal findings. No evidence of inflammation or infection.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Gram-positive cocci (e.g., Staphylococcus spp.)</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">May represent contaminants or&nbsp;normal flora, unless clinically correlated with infection.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"px-two bg-background border-border shadow-subtle pointer-coarse:opacity-100 right-xs absolute bottom-0 flex gap-2 rounded-lg border py-px opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"my-0\">&nbsp;</p>",
